{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"e9e059b2-4f9d-4ae7-baf2-249d80a5ad06","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented a proper caching strategy for the system prompt.\n\n### Key Update\n- **File:** `bot.py`\n- Refactored `build_system` to separate static instructions (cached) from dynamic athlete context (ephemeral). This prevents the entire prompt from being re‑cached after each `save_fact`, eliminating the token‑cost spike.\n\n### Details\n- Static instructions are now a standalone message.\n- Athlete‑specific context is returned as a second message with `cache_control: {type: \"ephemeral\"}`.\n\n### Documentation\nThe changes are summarized in the artifact **[ANSWER.md](/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/e9e059b2-4f9d-4ae7-baf2-249d80a5ad06/ANSWER.md)**.\n","duration_seconds":28.877866,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":15298,"output_tokens":2736,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":73472,"total_tokens":18034}}}
